  "id": "italian-rotini-pasta-salad",
  "name": "Italian Rotini Pasta Salad",
  "subtitle": "Chilled pasta with creamy dressing and crisp vegetables",
  "description": "Tender rotini is tossed with a garlicky mayonnaise dressing, basil, tomatoes, peppers, and olives, then chilled for a refreshing salad.",
